Summary:
Acted on a full architectural review. Fixed two confirmed defects (test isolation
destroying demo data; non-atomic writes), two governance violations (indicators not
rule-driven; duplicated rule config), one correctness risk (three divergent date
parsers), removed a dead SQLAlchemy/Alembic layer, implemented the specified-but-absent
audit trail, typed and consolidated the frontend, and added CI. Authentication was
explicitly deferred by the user as out of scope for the Demo.

