- GET /api/farmers/{id}/indicators omitted calculation_trace, so the UI could show a
  score but never its explanation (contradicts AGENTS.md §6).
- Tailwind content globs were CWD-relative, so building from the repo root shipped a
  bundle with no styles (CSS 4.9 kB → 17.86 kB after the fix).
- Also fixed: seed script crashed when stdout was piped on Windows (cp950 codec).

